      "text": "🏗️ ⚓️ Big things are happening on the coast! \n\n@USCG is laying the foundation for a stronger future with the recapitalization of Station South Padre Island, following significant fire damage. Under the leadership of @POTUS and @Sec_Noem, the Coast Guard is leveraging the historic investment presented by the One Big Beautiful Bill Act to expand and modernize the station. This construction ensures the Service is equipped to safeguard the American people, defeat our adversaries, and protect the homeland at the southern border. \n\n#USCG @DHSgov",
