      "retweeted_tweet_id": null,
      "text": "Across 31,000 miles of U.S. maritime border, the @USCG maritime fighting force is protecting sovereignty and stopping illegal immigration. \n\nThis week: \n\n⚓ USCGC David Duren crew interdicted 21 aliens off La Jolla, CA. \n\n⚓ Station Miami interdicted a 31-foot vessel with 13 aliens and 2 suspected human smugglers near the Miami River. \n\n⚓ USCGC Rollin Fritch crew transferred 8 aliens to Bahamian authorities after an unlawful voyage off Miami. \n\nVigilance at sea means security at home. \n\n@DHSgov #USCG #MaritimeSecurity #ImmigrationEnforcement #WeOwnTheSea",
      "text_resolved": "Across 31,000 miles of U.S. maritime border, the @USCG maritime fighting force is protecting sovereignty and stopping illegal immigration. \n\nThis week: \n\n⚓ USCGC David Duren crew interdicted 21 aliens off La Jolla, CA. \n\n⚓ Station Miami interdicted a 31-foot vessel with 13 aliens and 2 suspected human smugglers near the Miami River. \n\n⚓ USCGC Rollin Fritch crew transferred 8 aliens to Bahamian authorities after an unlawful voyage off Miami. \n\nVigilance at sea means security at home. \n\n@DHSgov #USCG #MaritimeSecurity #ImmigrationEnforcement #WeOwnTheSea",
